,"body":"Please have a look at the code below.  In order to achieve the exact same behavior on both platforms, I need to invert the shouldShowRationale handling logic. I don't feel this is right, and requires platform-specific branches, which is exactly what a KMP library should solve IMHO.  This happens with any kind of permission (at least Camera and Location, that I've tried). I didn't choose Camera for any particular reason.  Please let me know if I am misusing the library.  Thanks for your work and time.\n\n```\nval cameraPermissionState = rememberPermissionState(Permission.Camera)\nval isGranted = cameraPermissionState.status.isGranted\nval shouldShowRationale = cameraPermissionState.status.shouldShowRationale\n\n// ...\n\nif (isGranted) {\n    // Great ...\n} else {\n    if (isAndroid) {\n        if (shouldShowRationale) {\n            cameraPermissionState.openAppSettings()\n        } else {\n            cameraPermissionState.launchPermissionRequest()\n        }\n    } else if (isIos) {\n        if (shouldShowRationale) {\n            cameraPermissionState.launchPermissionRequest()\n        } else {\n            cameraPermissionState.openAppSettings()\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"MohamedRejeb","id":41842296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODQyMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41842296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohamedRejeb/repos","events_url":"h